  "description": ".NET client library for InferHub — a self-hosted, Ollama-compatible LLM inference mesh. Typed requests over HTTP, dependency-injection friendly, small surface. Point it at a coordinator and call chat, generate (blocking + streaming), embeddings, the vector data-plane (upsert/query/retrieve), opt-in RAG retrieval (grounded chat/generate with source ids), model listing and status from C#.",
